dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "KO History \u2014 Dashboard REST API Explorer",
  "description": "Live exploration of Splunk's dashboard REST API: the base data/ui/views endpoint (both formats) vs DS-only version history.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_views": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "All views (base endpoint)",
      "options": {
        "query": "| rest /servicesNS/-/-/data/ui/views count=0 splunk_server=local\n| rename \"eai:acl.app\" as app, \"eai:acl.sharing\" as sharing, \"eai:acl.owner\" as owner, \"eai:data\" as data\n| eval format=case(match(data,\"(dashboard|form) version=.2.\"),\"Dashboard Studio\",match(data,\"<form\"),\"Simple XML (form)\",match(data,\"<dashboard\"),\"Simple XML\",true(),\"Other / HTML\")\n| eval native_history=if(format==\"Dashboard Studio\",\"supported (DS feature)\",\"not supported (SXML)\")\n| table title app format sharing owner updated native_history\n| sort app title"
      }
    },
    "ds_apps": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "Apps",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| stats count by app | sort app"
      }
    },
    "ds_counts": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "Format breakdown",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| stats count by format | sort - count"
      }
    },
    "ds_total": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "Total views",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| stats count"
      }
    },
    "ds_ds": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "DS count",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| search format=\"Dashboard Studio\"\n| stats count"
      }
    },
    "ds_sxml": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "SXML count",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| search format=\"Simple XML*\"\n| stats count"
      }
    },
    "ds_views_f": {
      "type": "ds.chain",
      "name": "Filtered catalog",
      "options": {
        "extend": "ds_views",
        "query": "| search format=\"$fmt$\" app=\"$selApp$\""
      }
    },
    "ds_history": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Native version history (DS-only)",
      "options": {
        "query": "| rest /servicesNS/-/$h_app$/data/ui/views/$h_name$/history splunk_server=local\n| fields - eai:* splunk_server\n| head 100"
      }
    }
  },
  "inputs": {
    "input_fmt": {
      "type": "input.dropdown",
      "title": "Format",
      "options": {
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "All",
            "value": "*"
          },
          {
            "label": "Dashboard Studio",
            "value": "Dashboard Studio"
          },
          {
            "label": "Simple XML",
            "value": "Simple XML*"
          },
          {
            "label": "Other / HTML",
            "value": "Other / HTML"
          }
        ],
        "defaultValue": "*",
        "token": "fmt"
      }
    },
    "input_app": {
      "type": "input.dropdown",
      "title": "App",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_apps"
      },
      "options": {
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "All",
            "value": "*"
          }
        ],
        "defaultValue": "*",
        "token": "selApp"
      },
      "encoding": {
        "label": "primary.app",
        "value": "primary.app"
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "md_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "name": "md_intro",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# Dashboard REST API \u2014 explorer & explainer\n\nSplunk exposes dashboards through **two distinct REST layers**. This dashboard\nqueries them live so you can see the difference on *this* instance.\n\n### 1. `\u2026/data/ui/views` \u2014 the base endpoint (BOTH formats)\n`servicesNS/{owner}/{app}/data/ui/views` is **format-agnostic**: every view \u2014\nDashboard Studio (`<dashboard version=\"2\">`) *and* Classic Simple XML\n(`<dashboard>` / `<form>`) \u2014 is a row here. Create / read / update / delete all\nwork the same regardless of format; the format lives in the `eai:data` envelope.\nThe breakdown and catalog below are pulled straight from this endpoint.\n**KO History uses exactly this endpoint** for its snapshot backups, preview\nslots, and one-click restore \u2014 which is why it works for both formats.\n\n### 2. `\u2026/data/ui/views/{name}/history` & `/revision` \u2014 version history (DS-only)\nNative dashboard **version history** is a *Dashboard Studio* feature\n(Splunk 10.x). Its REST surface (`/history`, `/revision`) only applies to Studio\ndashboards, is created **only on explicit save**, lives **with** the dashboard\n(delete it \u2192 lose the history), and is gated (single search head; not on\nFIPS-mode Windows). Click any **Dashboard Studio** row below to see its native\nrevisions; a **Simple XML** row returns nothing \u2014 there is no native history for\nclassic dashboards.\n\n### Why KO History exists\nThe base API gives full CRUD for both formats, but **native versioning covers\nonly DS, only on save, stored with the object.** KO History adds versioning for\n**Simple XML too** (plus reports/alerts), via periodic snapshots into\n`index=ko_history` that **survive deletion** and **restore to any app** \u2014 filling\nexactly the gap this dashboard makes visible.\n"
      }
    },
    "viz_total": {
      "type": "splunk.singlevalue",
      "title": "Total views (data/ui/views)",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_total"
      }
    },
    "viz_ds": {
      "type": "splunk.singlevalue",
      "title": "Dashboard Studio (version=2)",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_ds"
      },
      "options": {
        "majorColor": "#0099E0"
      }
    },
    "viz_sxml": {
      "type": "splunk.singlevalue",
      "title": "Simple XML (classic)",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_sxml"
      },
      "options": {
        "majorColor": "#55C169"
      }
    },
    "viz_counts": {
      "type": "splunk.bar",
      "title": "Views by format \u2014 one endpoint serves all",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_counts"
      },
      "options": {
        "legendDisplay": "off"
      }
    },
    "viz_views": {
      "type": "splunk.table",
      "title": "View catalog \u2014 click a row to inspect its native version history",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_views_f"
      },
      "options": {
        "drilldown": "row",
        "count": 25
      },
      "eventHandlers": [
        {
          "type": "drilldown.setToken",
          "options": {
            "tokens": [
              {
                "token": "h_name",
                "key": "row.title.value"
              },
              {
                "token": "h_app",
                "key": "row.app.value"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "md_history": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "name": "md_history",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Native version history of the selected view\n\nDriven by `\u2026/data/ui/views/$h_name$/history` (app `$h_app$`). **Click a row in\nthe catalog above.** Expect revision rows for a **Dashboard Studio** dashboard\nthat was saved through the editor, and **no rows** for **Simple XML** \u2014 proving\nversion history is DS-only. (A freshly deployed DS dashboard that was never\nedited in-product may also be empty.)\n"
      }
    },
    "viz_history": {
      "type": "splunk.table",
      "title": "Native version history of \"$h_name$\" (DS-only)",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_history"
      },
      "options": {
        "drilldown": "none",
        "count": 25
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "type": "absolute",
    "options": {
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 1760,
      "display": "auto"
    },
    "globalInputs": [
      "input_fmt",
      "input_app"
    ],
    "structure": [
      {
        "item": "md_intro",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 1280,
          "h": 620
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_total",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 640,
          "w": 420,
          "h": 180
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_ds",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 430,
          "y": 640,
          "w": 420,
          "h": 180
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_sxml",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 860,
          "y": 640,
          "w": 420,
          "h": 180
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_counts",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 840,
          "w": 1280,
          "h": 240
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_views",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1100,
          "w": 1280,
          "h": 340
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "md_history",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1460,
          "w": 1280,
          "h": 130
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_history",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1600,
          "w": 1280,
          "h": 160
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
